    "notes": [
      "The northern Track Two follows the long northeastern straight, eastern hairpin, small upper chicane, outer northern loop, inner western U and paved southwestern return. The team identifies Track Two and links a complete February 2026 onboard lap. The operator independently identifies the northern circuit at https://apexmotorclub.com/track/. Coordinates come only from the independently georeferenced 18 September 2026 public Sentinel bands. The 5 June 2026 bands corroborate the western paved U and return diagonal; the separate lower drainage line and southern-course branches are excluded. The previously rejected candidate followed those unrelated branches and is not reused. Native 10 m samples are reprojected with nearest-neighbor resampling and contrast stretched without adding spatial detail. Intermediate straight vertices preserve the same observed corridor. The measured length is not adjusted to an advertised or supplied distance. Fine corner alignment, direction and historical equivalence remain draft; this is a coarse supporting course trace, not a surveyed racing line. No supplied diagram coordinates or private course boundary data are imported. Independently digitized aerial centerline: 4080.7 m. Direction, historical configuration and fine corner alignment remain draft; no course coordinates come from the comparison catalogue."
    ]
